 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A one-carbon compound with formula CO2 in which the carbon is attached to each oxygen atom by a double bond. A colourless, odourless gas under normal conditions, it is produced during respiration by all animals, fungi and microorganisms that depend directly or indirectly on living or decaying plants for food.</bp:comment>
