<bp:ProteinReference rdf:about="http://identifiers.org/uniprot/P35270">
 <bp:entityFeature rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ModificationFeature_ca6915b7075bdf9f0623319f420f7176" />
 <bp:entityFeature rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ModificationFeature_1314f1786ee2bd8295474d46ba7e1f55" />
 <bp:entityFeature rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ModificationFeature_552b59f06aa3bdd4085e35e301fa06e1" />
 <bp:entityFeature rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ModificationFeature_63ddf71d22071a17da889a38b4c875fc" />
 <bp:entityFeature rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ModificationFeature_853cf7a8369e0a88a98c4c413260566b" />
 <bp:entityFeature rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ModificationFeature_665bdb7f63e814577e6f888777ea13e7" />
 <bp:standardName rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sepiapterin reductase</bp:standardName>
 <bp:xref rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/UnificationXref_uniprot_knowledgebase_P35270" />
 <bp:xref rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/RelationshipXref_hgnc_symbol_SPR_identity" />
 <bp:organism rdf:resource="http://identifiers.org/taxonomy/9606" />
 <bp:displayName rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">SPRE_HUMAN</bp:displayName>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">SPR</bp:name>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.1.1.153</bp:name>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_rcsb_pdb_1Z6Z_see-also</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://biocyc.org/biopax/biopax-level3ProteinReference81961</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://www.phosphosite.org/phosphosite.owl#po_10578</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_HPRD_01632_identity</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://mirtarbase.mbc.nctu.edu.tw/#ref_6697</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION: Catalyzes the final one or two reductions in tetra-hydrobiopterin biosynthesis to form 5,6,7,8-tetrahydrobiopterin.CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=L-erythro-7,8-dihydrobiopterin + NADP(+) = H(+) + NADPH +sepiapterin; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:18953, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378,ChEBI:CHEBI:16095, ChEBI:CHEBI:43029, ChEBI:CHEBI:57783,ChEBI:CHEBI:58349; EC=1.1.1.153;CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=(6R)-L-erythro-5,6,7,8-tetrahydrobiopterin + 2 NADP(+) =6-pyruvoyl-5,6,7,8-tetrahydropterin + 2 H(+) + 2 NADPH;Xref=Rhea:RHEA:32627, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:57783,ChEBI:CHEBI:58349, ChEBI:CHEBI:59560, ChEBI:CHEBI:136564;EC=1.1.1.153;BIOPHYSICOCHEMICAL PROPERTIES:Kinetic parameters:KM=14.3 uM for sepiapterin {ECO:0000269|PubMed:11825621};KM=10 uM for NADPH {ECO:0000269|PubMed:11825621};SUBUNIT: Homodimer. {ECO:0000269|Ref.13}.SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Cytoplasm.PTM: In vitro phosphorylation of Ser-213 by CaMK2 does not changekinetic parameters. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:11825621}.DISEASE: Dystonia, DOPA-responsive, due to sepiapterin reductasedeficiency (DRDSPRD) [MIM:612716]: A form of DOPA-responsivedystonia. In the majority of cases, patients manifest progressivepsychomotor retardation, dystonia and spasticity. Cognitiveanomalies are also often present. The disease is due to severedopamine and serotonin deficiencies in the central nervous systemcaused by a defect in BH4 synthesis. Dystonia is defined by thepresence of sustained involuntary muscle contractions, oftenleading to abnormal postures. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:11443547,ECO:0000269|PubMed:16650784, ECO:0000269|PubMed:17159114}.Note=The disease is caused by mutations affecting the generepresented in this entry.SIMILARITY: Belongs to the sepiapterin reductase family.{ECO:0000305}. COPYRIGHT: UniProt Consortium (www.uniprot.org). Distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs License.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">SPRE_HUMAN Reviewed; 261 AA.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://identifiers.org/refseq/NP_003115</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_uniprotkb_P35270_identity</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://www.ctdbase.org/#ref_protein_gene_6697</bp:comment>
</bp:ProteinReference>

<bp:RelationshipXref rdf:about="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/RelationshipXref_chebi_CHEBI_64570_see-also">
